'''Angel Fanboy '''(天使愛好家, ''Tenshi Aikō-ka'', '''Angel Fanboy''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

